<title>USA: CMA reports U.S. fourth quarter 1996 cocoa grind.</title>
<headline>CMA reports U.S. fourth quarter 1996 cocoa grind.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chocolate Manufacturers Association reported the following cocoa bean and product usage figures:</p>
<p>		   4th QUARTER	 4th QUARTER	   % CHANGE</p>
<p>			 1996		   1995</p>
<p> Beans Ground    95,352		 86,116*	     +10.73%</p>
<p> Liquor Melted    1,554		  2,272		-31.60%</p>
<p> Butter Melted   15,607		 17,457		-10.60%</p>
<p>*Note: Cocoa beans ground in tonnes have been adjusted to reflect currently transmitted restated and reconfirmed data for the 1995 fourth quarter.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
